<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR firms to 13.07 from 13.04pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR firms to 13.07 from 13.04pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month rose to 13.07 percent from 13.04 percent on Monday and the bid rate (Athibid) firmed to 12.59 from 12.55 percent.</p>
